1	1	ewc	1	enchoro-wildlife-camp	Enchoro Wildlife Camp	Near Oloolaimutia Gate, Masai Mara National Reserve	Kenya	["Restaurant", "Bar & lounge", "Free Wi-Fi in common areas", "Airport/Nairobi pickup", "Daily housekeeping", "Evening cultural performances", "Campsite for tents"]	A budget-to-semi-luxury tented camp a few minutes' drive from Oloolaimutia gate, the closest entrance to the Maasai Mara National Reserve. Offers standard and superior canvas tents with private verandas, plus a restaurant, bar, and campground.	{"checkIn": "14:00", "checkOut": "10:00", "distanceFromGate": "~400m from Oloolaimutia gate"}	2026-08-31 16:19:31.160066
