rom JKIA airport", "Drinking water", "Government taxes"]	["Tips and gratuities", "International airfares", "Visas", "Optional nature walk at 20 USD per person", "Optional Masai village visit at 25 USD per person", "Optional hot air balloon safari at 450 USD per person", "Soft drinks and local beers", "Any government imposed increase in taxes and or park fees"]	[{"day": 1, "title": "Nairobi to Masai Mara", "description": "Depart Nairobi by road in the morning and travel across the Rift Valley towards the Masai Mara. Arrive at Enchoro Wildlife Camp in time for lunch, then meet your driver guide at 2 pm for your first game drive in the reserve. Enjoy dinner and spend the night at the camp."}, {"day": 2, "title": "Full Day in Masai Mara", "description": "After breakfast, leave the camp for a full day of game drives across the reserve, exploring areas with high concentrations of wildlife. The Masai Mara is home to more than 450 recorded species, and between July and September the plains fill with migrating wildebeest and zebra. Lunch is served in the park, after which you return to Enchoro Wildlife Camp for dinner and overnight."}, {"day": 3, "title": "Masai Mara Game Drives", "description": "Another day dedicated to wildlife viewing. You may choose a full day of game drives or separate drives with time in between for short excursions nearby. Your driver guide will gladly plan the day around your preferences. This is also the perfect opportunity to add a hot air balloon flight over the Mara plains, which can be arranged at an extra cost before booking."}, {"day": 4, "title": "Masai Mara to Nairobi", "description": "Enjoy breakfast at the camp, then say goodbye to the Masai Mara as you drive back to Nairobi with lunch on the way. On arrival you will be dropped at your city hotel or at JKIA airport depending on your flight timings."}]	4.8	27	Daily	Easy	2-7 persons	private	budget	t	f	27	2026-09-17 20:51:53.711681	aha	\N	\N
